From aaca6da1da1bba09160afd2c0570c5c834bd0da0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alona SolntsevaX <asolntsevax@asolntsevax-vm-u20.habana-labs.com>
Date: Tue, 08 Feb 2022 10:21:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-73766] gaudi2: add tpm pcr extend

Ppboot uses the signature of the preboot image, the 48 bytes of the 
signature are used for tpm pcr extend call
Erom tpm transfers signature of ppboot, Sha384 algo is used

Change-Id: I24acfe011e478e16d0a49383126952c5030c0746
Signed-off-by: Alona SolntsevaX <asolntsevax@asolntsevax-vm-u20.habana-labs.com>
---

